 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. PERF2.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  I   PIC 99.
 01  J   PIC 99.
 01  N   PIC 99.
 01  S   PIC 9(4).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM 3 TIMES ADD 1 TO S END-PERFORM.
     DISPLAY "T1 0003 " S.
     MOVE 4 TO N. MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM N TIMES ADD 2 TO S END-PERFORM.
     DISPLAY "T2 0008 " S.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM ADD-ONE 5 TIMES.
     DISPLAY "T3 0005 " S.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 4
         ADD I TO S
     END-PERFORM.
     DISPLAY "T4 0010 05 " S " " I.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM ADD-I VARYING I FROM 10 BY 5 UNTIL I > 20.
     DISPLAY "T5 0045 " S.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM 3 TIMES
         PERFORM 2 TIMES ADD 1 TO S END-PERFORM
     END-PERFORM.
     DISPLAY "T6 0006 " S.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM P1 THROUGH P2.
     DISPLAY "T7 0011 " S.
     MOVE 0 TO S. MOVE 0 TO N.
     PERFORM N TIMES ADD 1 TO S END-PERFORM.
     DISPLAY "T8 0000 " S.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 3
         PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > 2
             ADD 1 TO S
         END-PERFORM
     END-PERFORM.
     DISPLAY "T9 0006 " S.
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     PERFORM P1 THRU P2 2 TIMES.
     DISPLAY "TA 0022 " S.
     STOP RUN.
 ADD-ONE.
     ADD 1 TO S.
 ADD-I.
     ADD I TO S.
 P1.
     ADD 1 TO S.
 P2.
     ADD 10 TO S.
